    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "F. Attneave and M.D. Arnoult: \"The\nQuantitative Study of Shape and Pattern Perception.\" Psychological\nBulletin 53 (1956), pp. 452-471.\n\n\n\nJ.M. Vanderplas and E.A. Garvin: \"The Association Value of Random\nShapes.\" Journal of Experimental Psychology 57 (1959),\npp. 147-154.\n\n\n\nBit-101\nLaboratory: 02 mar 20; 02 apr 22/30; 02 may 03/12/23;\n02 jul 30; 02 aug 11; 02 nov 18.",
